  <FLAVOURTEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[The thunder of its hooves beats dreams into despair.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[« Cauchemars entrevus dans le sommeil sans bornes, Sirènes aux seins nus, mélusines, licornes (...) »
—Victor Hugo, La Légende des siècles]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[El trueno de sus cascos pisa los sueños hasta convertirlos en desesperación.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[Der Donner seiner Hufe verwandelt Träume in Verzweiflung.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[Il rombo dei suoi zoccoli trasforma i sogni in disperazione.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[その蹄の響きは、夢を絶望に変えてしまう。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA[놈의 천둥과 같은 발굽 소리에 희망이 절망으로 바뀐다.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[От грохота его копыт добрый сон становится кошмаром.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[O ressoar de seus cascos leva os sonhos ao desespero.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[他的铁蹄巨响将梦击入绝境。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[他的鐵蹄巨響將夢擊入絕境。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
  </FLAVOURTEXT>
